{"id":"2085442988537398276","kind":"answer","title":"我要日语到达N几才能大致看懂一篇日语小说？","author":"Jarrett Ye","original_authors":["Jarrett Ye"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"外语习得","date":"2026-09-21","updated":"2026-09-21","votes":142,"comment_count":34,"minutes":1,"chars":603,"keywords":["窄式阅读","二语习得","泛读","语境阅读","词汇学习"],"summary":"看懂一篇日语小说的难度其实没有那么高，直接上 Jiten 查一下最简单的轻小说： 去重后共 2644 个词，掌握 1082 个就覆盖了 90% 内容。 但是如果你按 JLPT 考级的词汇表去背，你全背下来，也不一定能覆盖这一千个词，因为轻小说的一些用词，JLPT 根本不考。 我大概是自学日语半年后开始看轻小说的，那个时候我的词…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/404366192/answer/2085442988537398276","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"推荐阅读"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"1YLjdaHz\">看懂一篇日语小说的难度其实没有那么高，直接上 Jiten 查一下最简单的轻小说：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1816\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ad3487585e7f424f452a3e7f981bccd5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1816\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1852\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ec4dae82f6579e607a418e85aa368d81_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1852\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"NIiq-4kS\">去重后共 2644 个词，掌握 1082 个就覆盖了 90% 内容。</p><p data-pid=\"4GpV7WNy\">但是如果你按 JLPT 考级的词汇表去背，你全背下来，也不一定能覆盖这一千个词，因为轻小说的一些用词，JLPT 根本不考。</p><p data-pid=\"IqGdspS4\">我大概是自学日语半年后开始看轻小说的，那个时候我的词汇量大约在 3000～4000 左右。</p><p data-pid=\"qGCZ3j_w\">我看的第一本轻小说是週に一度クラスメイトを買う話　～ふたりの時間、言い訳の五千円～，断断续续读了一个多月，十几个小时才读完，查了一千多个生词。阅读速度估计只有 6000 字符/小时 出头。</p><p data-pid=\"R4uK7kqA\">不过这个只是暂时的，多读几本难度相当的作品后，速度会越来越快：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2800\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ba991a0bd2cd58859b982aaf75cd20ba_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2800\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"sVu57YIQ\">我目前读得最快的一本是週クラ的第7卷。非常推荐初学者读週クラ来提升日语阅读水平。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1512\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1bb8c200e7816b27a845a12db809ea93_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1512\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"Q19sOmTg\">说完轻松的，再说难的。入间人间的新书难度有点超纲了，和奇诺之旅一个水平：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1280\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b4be654e97c78a2af3de910b535b05b2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1280\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1280\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f2989835a3c3cfb28052ccaa6dd0f05a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1280\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"I-u2CfYb\">动不动就是词频六七万名开外的词，恐怖如斯（bushi</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1578\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-28f49bc5c1aa7d2535f00b5e8b4f1cdc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1578\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ATqmj9oK\">不过这种词一般都是汉字词，除了有些不太会念，理解上倒是比较简单了。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2162\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-0390ac0ce72d20ba2549f8f8a500cc4f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2162\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"rFX4IwGH\">这种词你 N1 词汇背穿了也不会，只能多读小说积累。毕竟 N5～N1 所有词汇加起来，也就一万多。一般日语母语者词汇量都五六万，还远着呢。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">推荐阅读</h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cc6d1215501255e3b718e72c3e550562.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"最佳阅读沉浸——窄式阅读\" data-tm-id=\"2077813393189253839\" href=\"#/post/2077813393189253839\">最佳阅读沉浸——窄式阅读</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2528a7887565a7ec91a1f9b80ea8803f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"想问一下学日语的大佬，自学日语要怎么学？\" data-tm-id=\"2054997204230842302\" href=\"#/post/2054997204230842302\">想问一下学日语的大佬，自学日语要怎么学？</a><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-0f902ae3095f87532923b055369de227.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"有什么免费的日语学习软件？\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/1997820217334720129/answer/2052731244878763625\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">有什么免费的日语学习软件？</a><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cbd397721914f2d7866215b936db6ff1.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"对于日语初学者有什么值得看的日语读物？\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/20544217/answer/2050918040452216003\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对于日语初学者有什么值得看的日语读物？</a><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-554985ceb6b4b36f5b48d1df021e600b.jpg?needBackground=1&amp;source=edda2ec7\" data-draft-title=\"Yokubi 中文版\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/proje